r": "caution", "score": -35, "why": "Short-term, a daily bottoming setup is forming \u2014 but the bigger picture is bearish (weekly momentum curling up; investor cycle failed (broke its start low); last cycle left-translated (topped early)). A bounce here is COUNTER-TREND: daily-cycle lows that don't line up with a weekly-cycle low tend to be left-translated and fail, then cascade toward the larger cycle low \u2014 exactly the trap of buying a daily low in a falling investor cycle. The daily cycle has already failed (broke its own start low). Last cycle was left-translated (topped early) \u2014 a bearish structural tell.", "next": "Nimble traders only \u2014 small size, tight stop below 21.04. Not an investment buy; wait for the weekly timeframe to actually turn up (or a fresh investor-cycle low to confirm) before trusting it.", "weekly_ok": false, "regime": "bear", "regime_label": "BEARISH", "regime_why": "weekly momentum curling up; investor cycle failed (broke its start low); last cycle left-translated (topped early)", "regime_score": -4.0, "regime_line": "Bigger picture: BEARISH \u2014 weekly momentum curling up; investor cycle failed (broke its start low); last cycle left-translated (topped early) (investor cycle week 21 \u00b7 failed \u00b7 daily cycle broke its start low 20d ago).", "summary_line": "Short-term (daily): counter-trend bounce. Bigger picture (counter-trend): bearish.", "points": ["Bigger picture is bearish (counter-trend for a daily long)", "\u26a0 Failed cycle \u2014 price broke below the low that began this cycle (20d ago)", "Swing low printed (buyers rejected the low)", "Back above the 10-day average, and it's turning up", "Prior cycle topped early (a tiring-trend hint)"], "entry": {"tag": "BOUNCE \u2014 HIGH RISK", "tag_zh": "\u53cd\u5f39 \u2014 \u9ad8\u98ce\u9669", "urgency": "caution", "text": "Counter-trend bounce inside a bearish bigger picture. For nimble traders only \u2014 small size, tight stop below 21.04. If the daily low fails it